o at most one drone listed as eligible for it in CONTEXT (sensor,\navailability, battery, wind). Leave out an objective no eligible drone can take and say why in the explanation.\nOrder each drone's objectives as it should visit them. Request validate_route for each drone's order and one\ncheck_separation for the whole assignment when several drones fly.\nNever assign an objective to a drone that is not in its eligible_drones; if your explanation says an objective has\nno eligible drone, the proposal must leave it out. validate_route takes the drone's objective ids in visiting order.\nEvery tool call needs all its arguments.\nTOOLS: [{\"arguments\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"sequence\": {\"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"maxItems\": 6, \"minItems\": 1, \"title\": \"Sequence\", \"type\": \"array\"}, \"vehicle_id\": {\"maxLength\": 40, \"minLength\": 1, \"title\": \"Vehicle Id\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"vehicle_id\", \"sequence\"], \"title\": \"RouteArgs\", \"type\": \"object\"}, \"description\": \"site rules + battery/wind validation of one visiting order for one drone\", \"name\": \"validate_route\"}, {\"arguments\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"assignments\": {\"additionalProperties\": {\"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": \"array\"}, \"maxProperties\": 6, \"minProperties\": 1, \"title\": \"Assignments\", \"type\": \"object\"}}, \"required\": [\"assignments\"], \"title\": \"AssignmentArgs\", \"type\": \"object\"}, \"description\": \"spatio-temporal separation of a whole assignment (objective ids per drone)\", \"name\": \"check_separation\"}, {\"arguments\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"sequence\": {\"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"maxItems\": 6, \"minItems\": 1, \"title\": \"Sequence\", \"type\": \"array\"}, \"vehicle_id\": {\"maxLength\": 40, \"minLength\": 1, \"title\": \"Vehicle Id\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"vehicle_id\", \"sequence\"], \"title\": \"RouteArgs\", \"type\": \"object\"}, \"description\": \"build the QGC .plan of a route in memory (sha256, item count); nothing is saved or uploaded\", \"name\": \"plan_preview\"}]\nTASK (data): {\"drones\": [\"drone_01\", \"drone_02\", \"drone_03\"], \"goal\": \"assign each objective to at most one capable drone; routes must pass validation and separation\", \"objectives\": [{\"objective_id\": \"A1\", \"point_id\": \"POI_3\", \"required_sensor\": \"thermal\"}, {\"objective_id\": \"A2\", \"point_id\": \"POI_9\", \"required_sensor\": \"multispectral\"}], \"wind_speed_kmh\": 0.0}\nCONTEXT (data): [{\"data\": {\"drones\": [{\"available\": true, \"battery_percent\": 100.0, \"max_wind_kmh\": 30.0, \"sensors\": [\"rgb\"], \"takeoff_point\": \"TAKEOFF_1\", \"vehicle_id\": \"drone_01\"}, {\"available\": true, \"battery_percent\": 60.0, \"max_wind_kmh\": 20.0, \"sensors\": [\"multispectral\"], \"takeoff_point\": \"TAKEOFF_2\", \"vehicle_id\": \"drone_02\"}, {\"available\": true, \"battery_percent\": 21.5, \"max_wind_kmh\": 25.0, \"sensors\": [\"rgb\", \"thermal\"], \"takeoff_point\": \"TAKEOFF_3\", \"vehicle_id\": \"drone_03\"}], \"objectives\": [{\"eligible_drones\": [\"drone_03\"], \"objective_id\": \"A1\", \"point_id\": \"POI_3\", \"required_sensor\": \"thermal\"}, {\"eligible_drones\": [\"drone_02\"], \"objective_id\": \"A2\", \"point_id\": \"POI_9\", \"required_sensor\": \"multispectral\"}],...[4557 chars]"}, "provider": "ollama", "raw_sha256": "5c3a4afa3357ed949205c21f2304e0801b1ce0ac0a011766dff36e80005548da", "raw_text": "{\n  \"proposal\": {\n    \"assignments\": {\n      \"drone_01\": [],\n      \"drone_02\": [\"A2\"],\n      \"drone_03\": [\"A1\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"verify\": [\n    {\n      \"tool\": \"validate_route\",\n      \"arguments\": {\n        \"vehicle_id\": \"drone_02\",\n        \"sequence\": [\"A2\"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool\": \"validate_route\",\n      \"arguments\": {\n        \"vehicle_id\": \"drone_03\",\n        \"sequence\":